# The vendored KaTeX files have their SHA-256 written down in katex/SHA256SUMS
# and checked by a test. Git rewriting line endings on a Windows checkout
# changes those bytes and the test fails on a file nobody touched, so these are
# handed over exactly as they are stored.
katex/katex.min.js -text
katex/assets/katex.min.css -text
katex/assets/fonts/* binary
katex/SHA256SUMS -text
